    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time per output chunk (p50 / p95)",
      "description": "Pace of an answer once it has started: the time between two streamed chunks. It rises when the model runs partly on the CPU or the GPU is shared. Long answers weigh more than short ones.",
